fs in History is now also in Settings → Appearance, next to the eye button menu in History."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.52-53","version":"0.1.0-beta.52"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31177208,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"b1f5623081ba1d5c94722e7c9c352193456b46fa70c6a2e0a19ec1968c8a391e","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":32661030,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"c1c4c299765b7b821f5f7c05d23ed1d77381ff98981cc005a1a7fdbafd4a749d","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":34775442,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"1700d6cedff41c56366cd55811d353039d901862c73826b17d84e4f94bf90d66","update_signature":"fvfDQOy3/nnQsIz6leRFyY3lllC+mrtFtTe9glTCz1RrCddV7Sar6QIcpfVWcEoW/aMdBgIDo5WiSSACyiaaDw==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":28233728,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"8ef2aab770bb1638d738b607ff8c5fbe84854129b8f18636dec3e3a8b4e1b475","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.50-51-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":32707402,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.50-51.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"f7b12eb2df6ad44385c937b6df67a511c8ef8d76a5916b017357940f31760136","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.50-51.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":32704570,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.50-51_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"741d25f809c6691ee191c1167b7c4c8827554bdb09c40c45a03f9537ab31eaad","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.50-51/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.50-51_amd64.deb"}],"build":51,"channel":"beta","notes":["Save any commit as a ZIP file: right-click it in History, or use the archive button next to its hash in the commit details. The ZIP holds every file and folder of that commit in one folder, including submodules and Git LFS files. It also works for repositories on another computer. Hosts receive a new GitLama helper.","Unstaged files and folders can be added to .gitignore from their menu. GitLama suggests the entry that matches exactly that file or folder, and you can edit it first, for example to *.log. Hosts receive a new GitLama helper.","When an action fails, GitLama now shows a dialog instead of a banner at the top of the window. It shows what Git reported and copies a support report, optionally with Git's output.","When a fetch, pull or push fails for a reason GitLama recognises, it explains what happened and offers a fix. If another program, such as your editor, is using the repository, GitLama shows its lock files and lets you try again or remove stale locks. If two remote branches differ only in letter case, which macOS cannot store side by side, GitLama can repair this computer's copies and fetch again. If a push is rejected because the remote has newer commits, GitLama offers to fetch them. Remote hosts receive an updated helper.","The Fetch dialog has an option to keep remote branches that were deleted on the server."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.50-51","version":"0.1.0-beta.50"}],"schema_version":1,"trust":{"checksum":"sha256","manifest_signature":"Ed25519 detached signature over exact JSON bytes","signature_encoding":"base64"}}
